WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.043
Oliver was reading a graphic novel.

2
00:00:05.044 --> 00:00:08.996
"This is cool!" Oliver said.

3
00:00:08.997 --> 00:00:13.379
An explorer walked through a jungle.

4
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.869
Her name was Dana Swift.

5
00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:20.499
Thick branches blocked Dana's path.

6
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:27.122
She pushed them out of the way.

7
00:00:27.123 --> 00:00:31.593
Dana swam across a wide river.

8
00:00:31.594 --> 00:00:38.624
Oliver gulped. "Crocodiles!"

9
00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:41.443
Oliver quickly flipped the page.

10
00:00:41.444 --> 00:00:45.087
Dana fought off the crocodiles.

11
00:00:45.088 --> 00:00:49.159
Next she climbed up a mountain.

12
00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:52.947
"There's the secret cave!" Oliver said.

13
00:00:52.948 --> 00:00:55.607
Mom walked into the room.

14
00:00:55.608 --> 00:00:59.376
"Who wants to go for a hike?" she asked.

15
00:00:59.377 --> 00:01:04.100
"Me!" Emmy and Harry said.

16
00:01:04.101 --> 00:01:10.221
Oliver groaned. "I'm reading!"

17
00:01:10.222 --> 00:01:14.314
"You can read later," Emmy said.

18
00:01:14.315 --> 00:01:18.953
"Yeah, let's go!" Harry said.

19
00:01:18.954 --> 00:01:23.757
Everyone put on their hiking shoes.

20
00:01:23.758 --> 00:01:27.516
Mom drove to a state park.

21
00:01:27.517 --> 00:01:30.663
The trail was muddy.

22
00:01:30.664 --> 00:01:34.894
Oliver stepped carefully through the mud.

23
00:01:34.895 --> 00:01:37.738
Emmy's foot got stuck.

24
00:01:37.739 --> 00:01:41.118
"Ugh," she said.

25
00:01:41.119 --> 00:01:46.035
Thick branches hung across the trail.

26
00:01:46.036 --> 00:01:53.769
Oliver pushed them out of the way.

27
00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:57.613
"This stinks," Harry said.

28
00:01:57.614 --> 00:02:00.536
The trail crossed a stream.

29
00:02:00.537 --> 00:02:04.739
Oliver walked across on some stones.

30
00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:09.135
Mom's foot splashed into the water.

31
00:02:09.136 --> 00:02:13.758
Mom frowned. "Hmph."

32
00:02:13.759 --> 00:02:21.047
Now the trail went uphill.

33
00:02:21.048 --> 00:02:27.016
Emmy groaned. "This trail is steep."

34
00:02:27.017 --> 00:02:32.190
"Everything is wet and muddy!" Harry said.

35
00:02:32.191 --> 00:02:39.851
Mom nodded. "This hike was a bad idea."

36
00:02:39.852 --> 00:02:43.730
"No, it wasn't!" Oliver grinned.

37
00:02:43.731 --> 00:02:50.659
"It's just like the graphic novel!"

